This directory contains self-hosted web fonts:

- Plus Jakarta Sans (by Tokotype, Ghaith Kakish): SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
  https://github.com/tokotype/Plus-Jakarta-Sans/blob/master/OFL.txt
- Instrument Serif (by Rodrigo Fuenzalida, Jordan Engel / Instrument): SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
  https://github.com/Instrument/Instrument-Serif/blob/main/OFL.txt
- Inter (by Rasmus Andersson): SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
  https://github.com/rsms/inter/blob/master/LICENSE.txt

All fonts are freely distributable and usable under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
